    <!-- ===== END-OF-SHIFT FOOTAGE POPUP (VR 588 = show_clear_popup) =====
         Seven components render as a modal confirmation dialog when the
         operator presses END SHIFT and product_length >= 1 ft.
         All share the same Visible binding: VR(588).0.
         Z-order: overlay first (lowest), buttons last (highest).
         PopupYes → Popup_Action (VR 589) = 2 → BASIC: reset footage + end shift.
         PopupNo  → Popup_Action (VR 589) = 3 → BASIC: end shift, keep footage. -->
